2026-11-06T02:57:03.2693490Z [0m
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2694259Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2695130Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2695563Z 
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2695947Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2696878Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2697437Z 
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2697856Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2698553Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2698886Z 
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2699980Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2701234Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2702033Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2702989Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2703416Z 
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2703781Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2704078Z 
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2704298Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2704708Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2704887Z 
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2705020Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2705203Z 
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2705547Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2706046Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2708724Z 
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2708943Z I will:
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2709308Z 
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2709704Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2711466Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2712274Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2713009Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2713404Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2713712Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2714146Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2714545Z    /root
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2726469Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2727193Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2738902Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T02:57:03.2739474Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
